---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="For Savindi — My Heart, My Inspiration" description="A quiet corner of the internet dedicated to Savindi.">
  <div style="max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 0;">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted, #888);">For Savindi</p>
    <div class="wayrule" style="margin: 1rem 0 2rem 0;"></div>
    
    <h1 class="display h1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
      My favorite piece of art.
    </h1>

    <p class="lede" style="font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-main, #222); margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      Some people spend their lives studying beauty, colors, and design. For me, I just look at you. You bring art, warmth, and brilliance into everything you touch.
    </p>

    <div class="section-card" style="margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 2.5rem; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.02); border-left: 3px solid var(--accent, #333); border-radius: 4px;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-family: var(--font-display, serif); font-size: 1.4rem;">The Visionary & The Researcher</h3>
      <p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
        Watching you pour your heart into your fashion PhD and your lifelong mission to make the industry sustainable is one of my greatest inspirations. You don't just dream of a better, greener world—you're actively researching and building it. 
      </p>
      <p style="line-height: 1.8; margin-top: 1rem;">
        Your passion for art, your sharp mind, and your fierce dedication to sustainability make you extraordinary.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin: 3rem 0; padding: 2rem; text-align: center; border: 1px dashed var(--border-color, #ddd); border-radius: 8px;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted, #666); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Memories & Inside Jokes</p>
      <p style="font-style: italic; color: var(--text-secondary, #555); margin: 0;">
        [ This is where our favorite moments, inside jokes, and little things go... ]
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
